# 🤖 AI Workflow Architect

A premium single-page web application that helps users design complete AI-powered workflows for any industry or business process.

## 🚀 Features

- Interactive Workflow Builder
- End-to-End Process Mapping
- Workflow Timeline
- AI Tool Recommendations
- Alternative AI Tools
- Prompt Library
- Decision Trees
- Workflow Diagrams
- Progress Tracking
- Workflow Notes
- Bookmark Important Steps
- Time Estimation
- Best Practices
- Common Mistakes
- Expected Outputs
- Recommended AI Stack
- Future Automation Opportunities
- Learning Resources
- Responsive UI
- Dark Mode
- Local Storage
- Printable Workflow Guide

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript (ES6)


